            "created_at": "2025-09-16T22:46:32.52311+00:00",
            "notes": "Ability power only helps our pulse bombs so this may seem like an odd choice but [Sonic Recharger](item_c5e6a2c9-1bed-48fa-b539-01e76098a297) gives 25 HP more always, and 75 overhealth through regen.  Since we are doing hit and runs and just trying to be annoying we should always be engaging with the extra 75 hp.  This ability alone takes Tracer from a 175 hero to a 275 one.  \n\nIf you feel like you can't get much done without more weapon power or the enemies don't seem to be targeting you fast enough to be a threat, you can take [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) instead.\n\nYou need to do a lot of damage to get the same health from the lifesteal as someone who just puts on [Sonic Recharger](item_c5e6a2c9-1bed-48fa-b539-01e76098a297) but again it's more about if you need the damage at this point.",
