            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-16T22:46:32.52311+00:00",
            "notes": "[Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) is the best ability for this build and especially for [Quantum Clip](item_3a108115-ec6e-4b98-8074-1b015cf535f1).  The CD reduction helps allow for blinking on every reload so it will help itself by keeping the [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) up from [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448)\n\nAgain you may want [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) for more [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) compared to [Sonic Recharger](item_c5e6a2c9-1bed-48fa-b539-01e76098a297) but it really depends on how well you have been surviving.",
