            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-16T22:46:32.52311+00:00",
            "notes": "We take [Auto Recall](item_ae3dbebf-c306-4408-b698-6f666ace0a7c) for a cheat death each life.  At the same time we take [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) for a mini version of this where we get a big boost of overhealth if we get below 30%.\n\nThis boost to survivability lets us be more aggressive spending more time dueling with the backline.  If you start losing some of these safety nets you can back off a bit to play a bit more safe, but the worst case scenario is you are blinking back to the fight 10 seconds later with 2 more get out of jail free cards.\n\n[Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) also is a great boost for our CD reduction while also giving us faster regen on our health so we can re-engage much faster.",
