            "notes": "We should have plenty now to get [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) but by this round you should have a feel for your weak spots and plan accordingly.\n\nIf you are falling over a lot consider getting [Sonic Recharger](item_c5e6a2c9-1bed-48fa-b539-01e76098a297) again.\n\nIf you feel ok but wish you had more burst, consider [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) or [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb).\n\nIf everyone on the other team armored up because you keep pestering them you can grab [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27).",
